d for them to come here and then  sample the other great things that we  have it's all part of our future as a  town both investing in the new things  the great things are happening but also  making sure that we don't leave the  local people behind and i think the the  range of things that we're doing is so  important for our future and a great  part of uh our ambition to make margate  a free six five seven day a week place  to live work and play  [Music]

